---
import Headline from "../../shared/Headline.astro";
import Wrapper from "../../shared/Wrapper.astro";
import "./feedback.scss";
---

<div class="testimonials">
  <Wrapper classes="testimonials-wrapper">
    <div class="testimonials-title">
      <Headline hlstyle="two" ele="h2">What the Audience Says</Headline>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonials-containers">
      <div class="testimonials-quote">
        <p>
          “Marketing and branding can feel both overwhelming and easily
          overlooked for many new entrepreneurs but Suzy has an incredible
          ability to cut through that noise. In our SMARTstart program, she
          consistently takes complex marketing concepts and distills them into
          clear, actionable priorities that meet business owners exactly where
          they are in their journey.
        </p>
        <p>
          What sets Suzy apart from a standard presenter is her talent for
          making the content genuinely relatable. She uses real-world examples
          and approachable tools that help participants understand not just what
          they need to do, but why it matters and how to start, without feeling
          intimidated. She emphasizes the critical role that marketing strategy
          plays in long‑term business success and offers a variety of practical,
          affordable options that empower entrepreneurs to implement changes
          right away
        </p>
        <p>
          Our participants leave her sessions feeling informed, confident, and
          capable. Suzy doesn’t just teach marketing…she demystifies it and
          turns it into a strategic advantage for small business owners.”
        </p>
        <p>-Jessica W., City of Airdrie, Economic Development</p>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonials-quote">
        <p>
          “Taking this workshop was a great experience. It pushed me to slow
          down and dive deeper into my marketing challenges, helping me focus on
          my customers’ core problems and find meaningful ways to connect with
          them. By the end, I had a clear campaign outline and ideas for future
          campaigns.
        </p>
        <p>
          What made the experience even better was Suzy’s genuine care and
          dedication. It’s clear she’s truly passionate about helping businesses
          succeed. I also love that she runs a digital agency who work with real
          people who live in and serve our community.
        </p>
        <p>
          She truly understands the unique needs of local businesses and are
          genuinely invested in helping. If you’re ready to take control of your
          marketing, gain deeper insight into your business and uncover the
          tools and confidence to effectively market to your audience, check out
          this workshop.”
        </p>
        <p>- Danielle, Small Business Owner</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Wrapper>
</div>
